OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain and
OL,6,Fhigh ground snow carrying on into the
OL,7,Fevening and for much of the night.
OL,8,FRain turning patchy in the east later
OL,9,Fin the night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FCloudy with further lighter
OL,12,Frain on Wednesday morning, rain
OL,13,Fturning patchy through the afternoon
OL,14,Fand evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,17,Fwith a few bright spells on Thursday
OL,18,Fbut winds strengthening. Further rain
OL,19,Fon Friday, wintry again over the
OL,20,Fhills. Turning brighter but cold again
OL,21,Flater on Friday and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
